*** IMPORTANT NOTICE ***After You have selected your Charcter types. Turn over the discinorder to access the levels ofplay. *** The Editor *** Type *EDITOR to load the Level editor. Then turn over the discto edit the levels. *** The Default option ***  Type *DEFAULT to restore the level of your choice back to itsorginal format before editing.This also must be performed on the other side of this disc*** IMPORTANT ****EDITOR and *DEFAULT command fileson the otherside of this disc arefor the BBC model B ONLY!